      "cooked": "<p>My spelling is horrible, so I frequently write my replies in Google Docs for the spellcheck, and then paste over. However, when I do this my reply is bolded and I cannot un-bold it either by clicking the bold button or ctrl+b, I have to switch to the plaint text editor and delete the lines that are bolding my reply. Is there something I'm screwing up? It does not do this when I paste from Notepad.</p>\n<p><b>An example of pasting from Google Docs.</b></p>",
