      "raw": "<p>My spelling is horrible, so I frequently write my replies in Google Docs for the spellcheck, and then paste over. However, when I do this my reply is bolded and I cannot un-bold it either by clicking the bold button or ctrl+b, I have to switch to the plaint text editor and delete the lines that are bolding my reply. Is there something I'm screwing up? It does not do this when I paste from Notepad.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><b id=\"docs-internal-guid-36fa8185-7fff-b042-c81d-575d719e457a\">An example of pasting from Google Docs.</b></p>",
